---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const title = 'Privacy Policy | KawaiiPlay';
const description = 'Read the KawaiiPlay privacy policy to learn what data we collect, how cookies and advertising work on this site, and your privacy choices.';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} path="/privacy-policy/">
  <main class="container">
    <article class="content-page">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="updated-note">Last updated: January 2026</p>

      <p>Welcome to KawaiiPlay ("we", "us", "our"). This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect information when you visit ubg2028.github.io (the "Site") and play the free browser games listed on it.</p>

      <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>We do not require you to create an account or submit personal information to play games on KawaiiPlay. The information we do process falls into these categories:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Local device storage:</strong> features like Favorites, Recently Played, daily play streaks, and star ratings are stored only in your browser's local storage. This data never leaves your device and is not sent to our servers.</li>
        <li><strong>Automatically collected data:</strong> standard technical information such as browser type, device type, approximate location (country/region), pages visited, and referring URLs, typically gathered through analytics and advertising partners.</li>
        <li><strong>Cookies and similar technologies:</strong> used for site functionality, remembering your theme preference, and by advertising partners to serve relevant ads (see Section 3).</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>2. How We Use Information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To operate, maintain, and improve the Site and its games.</li>
        <li>To understand aggregate usage patterns and site performance.</li>
        <li>To display advertising, including personalized advertising where permitted.</li>
        <li>To detect, prevent, and address technical issues or abuse.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Advertising & Google AdSense</h2>
      <p>KawaiiPlay uses third-party advertising companies, including Google AdSense, to serve ads when you visit our Site. These companies may use cookies, web beacons, or similar technologies to collect information about your visits to this and other websites in order to provide advertisements about goods and services of interest to you.</p>
      <p>Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads based on your visits to this Site and/or other sites on the Internet. You may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Ads Settings</a>. Alternatively, you can opt out of some third-party vendors' use of cookies for personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">www.aboutads.info</a>.</p>

      <h2>4. Cookies</h2>
      <p>Cookies are small text files stored on your device. We use functional cookies (for example, to remember your dark/light theme choice) and allow advertising partners to set cookies for ad delivery and measurement. You can disable cookies through your browser settings, though some parts of the Site may not function as intended without them. See our <a href="/cookie-policy/">Cookie Policy</a> for more detail.</p>

      <h2>5. Third-Party Game Content</h2>
      <p>Some games on KawaiiPlay are embedded from third-party providers via iframe. When you play an embedded game, the provider of that game may independently collect data according to its own privacy policy. We encourage you to review the privacy practices of any third-party game provider.</p>

      <h2>6. Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>KawaiiPlay is a general-audience site and does not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe a child has provided us with personal information, please contact us so we can address it.</p>

      <h2>7. Your Choices & Rights</h2>
      <p>Depending on your location, you may have rights to access, correct, or delete personal data held about you by our advertising partners, and to opt out of the sale or sharing of personal information for targeted advertising. Because KawaiiPlay itself does not maintain user accounts or a server-side database of personal data, most such requests should be directed to the relevant advertising partner (e.g., Google) using the links in Section 3.</p>

      <h2>8. Data Retention</h2>
      <p>Local-storage features (favorites, recently played, streaks, ratings) remain on your device until you clear your browser data or use in-site controls to remove them. We do not retain this information on our servers.</p>

      <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated "Last updated" date.</p>

      <h2>10. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please visit our <a href="/contact-us/">Contact Us</a> page.</p>
    </article>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
